    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malaykamoó wák niri hardáh. Inós a malaykamoó wák baraá malaykeedá' faanqwe, tidá' slooqa'aá faanqw gi koom. Inós iri amor'eé' axweés iri báy, «Qwaláng amoorí. Aníng sakwasleemár tsaatuso'oodá' ur ngi dirógií laqaám. Inós a tidá' aa iwit gawaá ma'aá yaariir i alé. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawituú baraá yaamu aa fuquús nee inós. Nee mukduú baraá yaamaá hoót kwaa oonitimís ar difaáír tsaatu'uumarós.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malaykamoodá' aníng iri ar tláy ar baraá qeeru ay baraá xaanxaay. /Ameeni ngiri ár aa iwít gawaá makiito'ór ló'wa daa/aat. Makiito'oorí i háts umér /ooslisliingo. Sagér faanqw ga koón nee xareemaá mibaango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee slám /ameenidá' kaa tsiitiís inqwaruú sirda/atene nee oo da/atén. Inós kaa parootuús ar sahaábu nee ar tlaa/edá' tlaxo uren, nee ar kwaslaá hhohho'. Inós i xooslmoó sahaábu koón baraá dakose. Xooslmoowí aa haáts muruú tlakwe nee umuúqo slasla/aruú tsaatu'uumarose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee baraá gitsee/awose umuú naaqo kwaa gooín, «Gixsár ur ar Babuloni, aayór tsaatuuse sleémeero nee aayór slasla/aru sleémeero oo baraá yaamu.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng ngiri tsaáhh adór /ameenidá' kara oonitiís nee tseerér múk hhohhó' sleémeero oo Mungú, nee ar tseerér mukdá' taa tsuú/ as Yesu kuwa lamabu'ún.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng inós ngiwa ár niri ló'wa waa/oó/. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malaykamoodá' aníng iri báy, «Gár ta waa/oo/amiin a milá? Aníng naaqór /ameenirí ngi dirók i oó', nee ar makiito'oorí /ameenirí ga gagariim, tí sagér faanqw ga koom, nee xareemaá mibaangw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Makiito'oodá' taa aán inós geeraawo i deer, ala hamí i káhh. Nee inós i ti'ít baraá bohongwdá' aa tsarere'eét wa ale, nee iri tleér amór qwanaay. Nee múk baraá yaamuú wa hoót, kwí umer'ín taa gooinká baraá kitaábuú slafiingw iimír yaamu kiwa tleehhiiká, inooín ta waa/oo/ qoomár makiito'oodá' bar kaa ár. Asma makiito'oorí geeraawo i deer, ala hamí i káhh, nee aluuwo i hardát.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Baraá kaangwihe gár ta slai a fuquraangw, nee sagalooa. Sageedá' faanqw a tlom'aá faanqw awa /ameenidá' aa al iwít. Nee slám sageedá' a waawituú faanqw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawituú kooán kwaa daraáhh qaroó alé, nee oo wák i deer. Oo hatlá' naa hardihiiká. Kwí bir naa hardáh, inós deelór iwa hooti ka ureeká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee makiito'oodá' geeraawo dáw nee hamí i káhh, inós an waawutmooduú dakaát. Nee slám inós an waawutmoó wák baraá wawitaádá' faanqwe, nee inós i baraá qwanoó káy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Xareemidá' mibaangw awa taa aán a waawituú mibaangw. Inooín waawuti'iima kaa slayká. Ala inooín waawuti'iima ka sláy tawa adór waawitá ar har qoomár looár wák dinkwa nee makiito'oodá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín axweesantaín a wak. Gár inooín ta slai a makiito'oodá' kan /uuruuín i haniis nee aleesleemuuín. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooínaká' ta slaaqw nee Deelmoó bee/i. Ala Deelmoó bee/i inooín gi ar baa/, asma inós a Aakoó bariise, nee slám inós a Waawutmoó waawitá. Nee mukós kudá' taa ateét nee oo taa tsawaár nee oo inkihhím, inooín baali ngi slayá' dinkwa nee inós.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo malaykamoodá' iri báy, «Ma'aydá' taa aán, kudá' /ameenidár tsaatuso'o aa al iwít, a muu nee boo/aay nee xoordu nee tsifri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee xareemidá' mibaangw awa taa aán, nee makiito'oodá', kuká' /ameenidár tsaatuso'o ngi aahhiyá'. Inooín /ameenidá' ka liitlakuso'o tleehh nee kari /aankweetsiis, fu'unaywós kiri /aay, nee kari xaawúy ar asla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma Mungú inslawaywí gwa qaás baraá muner'ín i aleeró as kawa tleehhi tidá' inós i slai, nee inooín tiwa axweesani slaslaya' as waawuti'iimar'ín kawa haniisi dír makiito'oodá', ay dír axweesanoó Mungú i boo/i.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Nee /ameenidá' taa aán a gixsadá' ur, tidá' waawituú baraaká' yaamu gu sawaawuti'ii'iim.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
